WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.140
Gosh! Why is Mitsuki so worried
about Madoka Wakamatsu?!

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:08.140
She says she can't let her be
and starts chasing after her,

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:10.200
and she even ends up
getting soaked!

00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:15.100
Not only that, she encourages
the disheartened Madoka to sing again!

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:19.670
She's such a simple,
good-natured person.

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:22.940
So, I wonder what's
going to happen today...

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:28.700
Got that?

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:29.740
Yes.

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:06.200
Okay, we're going to
decide the groups.

00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:09.300
Draw a lot from this box
one person at a time!

00:02:10.070 --> 00:02:12.440
Mitsuki, I hope we're
in the same group.

00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:13.300
Yeah!

00:02:23.670 --> 00:02:25.800
<i>Whoa, my heart's racing!</i>

00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:28.940
I'm Group F.
What about you, Mitsuki?

00:02:32.370 --> 00:02:33.370
Group F!

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:36.040
We're together!
All right, Mitsuki!

00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:38.540
Over here, over here!

00:02:39.140 --> 00:02:40.770
Group F is over here!

00:02:41.570 --> 00:02:42.570
Emi's with us too?

00:02:42.900 --> 00:02:43.570
Looks like it!

00:02:43.770 --> 00:02:44.440
Oh...

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:46.340
What about Machida?

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:48.100
Well, actually...

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:50.970
Hey, Group B is over here!

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:52.340
Oh! Me, me!

00:02:54.870 --> 00:02:58.470
It's too bad that Machida
isn't in our group.

00:02:58.670 --> 00:03:00.340
Yeah... I guess.

00:03:00.770 --> 00:03:01.970
But we'll be on the bus—

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:04.200
Are you okay?!

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:05.070
Yeah.

00:03:05.940 --> 00:03:06.940
It's nothing new.

00:03:07.300 --> 00:03:08.300
I'm fine.

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:11.700
See?

00:03:19.870 --> 00:03:23.700
<i>Thank you very much for coming</i>
<i>to the appreciation party</i>

00:03:23.740 --> 00:03:25.170
<i>for the success of "Eternal Snow."</i>

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:30.400
<i>With everyone's help, we were able to</i>
<i>get into the top ten this time as well.</i>

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:34.970
<i>Now then, we will have a few words</i>
<i>of greeting from Full Moon.</i>

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:42.170
<i>Thank you for taking</i>
<i>the time to come here today!</i>

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:53.940
Oh, Dr. Wakaoji!

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:57.870
- Shall we go?
- Yes!

00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:08.800
You're still going to eat?

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:09.640
Why?

00:04:09.670 --> 00:04:11.070
No, it's nothing.

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:16.040
Why don't you eat too, Takuto?
You have to fill up in autumn!

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:20.000
Well, the recording was fun.

00:04:20.270 --> 00:04:21.870
I hope we get to record together again.

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:22.870
Yeah.

00:04:23.170 --> 00:04:25.340
Thank you for
the wonderful performance.

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:29.940
Next time we're going to have
a secret session in the studio.

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:31.300
You should come, Wakaoji.

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:32.140
Sure.

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:34.040
If you'd like,
why don't you join us?

00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:37.240
What?! Is it okay?!
Yes, I'll go!

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:43.870
<i>Oh, I should tell Dr. Wakaoji about</i>
<i>what happened with my throat today.</i>

00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:47.370
It'll be late at night,
so we can't invite Full Moon!

00:04:47.770 --> 00:04:50.670
She'll be on her school trip anyways.

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:52.370
Umm...

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:53.400
Hmm? What is it?

00:04:53.870 --> 00:04:54.870
Oh... Nothing.

00:04:55.340 --> 00:04:58.500
Umm... Please look forward to
a souvenir from my school trip, okay?

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:01.400
You don't have to get me anything.

00:05:01.770 --> 00:05:05.100
School trip, huh? How nice.
Right in the prime of youth!

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:07.940
What's with you?
You sound like an old man!

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:10.870
You don't have to say it like that!

00:05:12.270 --> 00:05:17.140
<i>Oh well! It wouldn't be good to</i>
<i>make him worry over that little cough.</i>

00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:23.870
I ate a lot! No more will fit!

00:05:24.240 --> 00:05:27.270
Of course!
If you ate as much as you did...

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:31.340
I don't feel good.
Maybe I'll take some stomach medicine!

00:05:32.200 --> 00:05:34.940
You shouldn't put anything else
in your stomach.

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:40.800
<i>I wasn't able to tell Dr. Wakaoji</i>
<i>about my throat,</i>

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:43.340
<i>but I don't want to</i>
<i>miss the school trip.</i>

00:05:43.870 --> 00:05:47.300
<i>Well, I'll be fine.</i>
<i>This is par for the course.</i>

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:49.140
What're you doing?

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:52.570
Hmm? Oh, it's information
about my school trip.

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:54.200
Oh...

00:05:54.670 --> 00:05:57.100
What? Isn't this your new song?

00:05:57.740 --> 00:06:01.570
Yeah! We're going to sing it on
the bus and the bullet train!

00:06:03.440 --> 00:06:04.100
Hmm?

00:06:04.270 --> 00:06:05.870
You can't have a school trip without...

00:06:07.140 --> 00:06:08.140
Ghost stories!

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:09.270
Wrong, wrong!

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:10.740
Then, being lectured by the teacher!

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:14.300
Wrong again!
You can't have a school trip without...

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:16.100
Wooden sword souvenirs?

00:06:18.970 --> 00:06:20.670
Pillow fights!

00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:22.170
Hey, now you've done it!

00:06:23.370 --> 00:06:24.370
Eat this!

00:06:24.540 --> 00:06:25.540
Be quiet—

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:29.200
Jeez, don't bother me!

00:06:30.840 --> 00:06:32.140
I said no!

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:36.540
Goodness...

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:38.600
What's she doing making
a ruckus by herself?

00:06:39.140 --> 00:06:45.000
Her school trip is near,
so I'm sure Mitsuki is just very excited.

00:06:45.640 --> 00:06:47.440
No more!

00:06:49.670 --> 00:06:53.700
WELCOME TO KYOTO!

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:54.700
MAP OF KYOTO'S TEMPLES

00:06:54.800 --> 00:06:55.800
How's it going?

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:58.800
Were you able to find places your group
wants to go on the school trip?

00:06:59.340 --> 00:07:01.900
When you think of Kyoto,
you think of maiko, the apprentice geishas.

00:07:02.170 --> 00:07:03.870
Where can you find maiko?

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:06.440
Mount Hiei? Kiyomizu Temple?

00:07:06.870 --> 00:07:09.400
Really? Mitsuki, search!

00:07:09.640 --> 00:07:10.640
Okay!

00:07:10.870 --> 00:07:12.900
Ma...i...ko...

00:07:15.640 --> 00:07:17.370
LIFESTYLE AND CULTURE
PLACES TO EAT
PLACES TO STAY
Let me see... Shi...

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:18.870
Shien?

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:20.040
Shien?

00:07:20.570 --> 00:07:22.640
You don't read it Shien. It's Gion!

00:07:22.900 --> 00:07:23.570
Huh?!

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:25.770
You said Shien! How embarrassing!

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:26.800
Shut up!

00:07:32.440 --> 00:07:33.100
Mitsuki!

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:34.270
Are you okay?

00:07:35.870 --> 00:07:37.070
<i>I-It hurts.</i>

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:40.040
Mr. Yamane! Mitsuki is...

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:41.940
Mitsuki! Mitsuki!

00:07:57.600 --> 00:08:01.240
I see... She was really
looking forward to it, but...

00:08:02.470 --> 00:08:05.740
We will pay careful attention,
so could you please let her...

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:06.840
No.

00:08:07.470 --> 00:08:11.370
If something should happen on the trip,
it would cause trouble.

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:15.140
So she will not be going
on the school trip.

00:08:22.170 --> 00:08:22.840
What?!

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:26.140
It's in the interest
of your health!

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:31.240
And you must not cause
trouble for everyone.

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:32.270
But...

00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:33.170
What?

00:08:33.670 --> 00:08:35.940
There's only one school trip.

00:08:36.670 --> 00:08:39.940
It's not just your problem.
Give it up!

00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:47.400
I tried to tell Dr. Wakaoji, but he's off
today and tomorrow for something.

00:08:47.870 --> 00:08:50.040
So I'll try consulting with him
early next week.

00:08:50.970 --> 00:08:51.640
Okay.

00:08:56.570 --> 00:09:00.370
What?! No way!
We can't go on the school trip?

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:05.700
Man, I was really looking forward to it!

00:09:05.740 --> 00:09:07.200
This isn't the time for that!

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:08.170
Huh?

00:09:11.470 --> 00:09:15.070
You're right. The one who's
the most upset is Mitsuki, huh?

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:17.140
And she has to worry
about her throat too.

00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:21.870
Remember Dr. Wakaoji's conditions
when he came on as producer.

00:09:23.440 --> 00:09:26.600
<i>First, that you'll undergo</i>
<i>regular checkups for your throat.</i>

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:29.000
<i>And second,</i>
<i>when push comes to shove,</i>

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:32.740
<i>you will follow my instructions,</i>
<i>including undergoing surgery, okay?</i>

00:09:34.370 --> 00:09:35.840
Th-That's bad!

00:09:35.870 --> 00:09:36.540
Right?!

00:09:36.770 --> 00:09:39.100
I'll have the checkup in her place!

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:41.070
That'd be totally obvious.

00:09:41.700 --> 00:09:45.070
Th-Then how about
manipulating the X-rays?!

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:48.100
Even if you were to cover it up
with a quick fix...

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:58.600
This isn't the time for you
to be all downcast, right?

00:09:58.900 --> 00:09:59.570
From now...

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:03.570
W-What is it?!

00:10:03.970 --> 00:10:07.540
Calm down!
Put yourself in her position!

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:14.770
Then what do we do?! If she gets surgery,
she might not be able to sing anymore!

00:10:15.770 --> 00:10:20.870
And things will get messy if she has
the surgery and ends up living longer.

00:10:21.270 --> 00:10:23.600
What should we do?!

00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:41.300
Have a good trip!

00:10:42.100 --> 00:10:44.070
Mitsuki, we'll be back with souvenirs!

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:46.140
I'll send you a postcard too!

00:10:46.440 --> 00:10:48.200
Okay! Take care!

00:10:53.770 --> 00:10:54.440
Hey!

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:58.100
I'm okay!
I just choked on the fumes.

00:10:58.540 --> 00:10:59.540
If you say so.

00:11:16.600 --> 00:11:18.840
Mitsuki is in Kyoto about now, huh?

00:11:19.140 --> 00:11:20.870
I hope it doesn't rain.

00:11:21.100 --> 00:11:24.340
Yeah. I hope she
creates nice memories.

00:11:24.640 --> 00:11:25.300
Yes.

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:52.170
<i>We're going to sing on the bus,</i>
<i>there and back!</i>

00:11:56.100 --> 00:12:04.570
How long has it been
since I fell in love with you?

00:12:05.240 --> 00:12:14.100
My feelings keep
getting stronger.

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:22.770
- They're silent like—
- ...like the snow.

00:12:23.400 --> 00:12:24.400
Takuto!

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:28.640
Don't stop. I've gone to
the trouble of singing with you.

00:12:31.900 --> 00:12:32.570
Okay!

00:12:33.300 --> 00:12:41.570
- They're silent like the snow.
- ...silent like the snow.

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:51.200
- But they keep building up.
- But they keep building up.

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:53.940
- Hold me tight.
- Hold me tight.

00:12:54.140 --> 00:12:56.100
- If loving someone...
- If loving someone...

00:12:56.140 --> 00:12:58.970
- was going to feel like this...
- was going to feel like this...

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:08.840
I wish I never
found out about love.

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:11.770
- I love you.
- I love you.

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:14.800
Mitsuki!

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:16.040
Meroko! Water!

00:13:16.240 --> 00:13:16.900
Right!

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:20.140
I-I'm okay. I can get it.

00:13:27.900 --> 00:13:29.640
Mitsuki!

00:13:55.940 --> 00:13:57.000
What does this mean?

00:13:57.840 --> 00:14:02.400
In my opinion,
she should have surgery.

00:14:02.540 --> 00:14:03.740
S-Surgery?!

00:14:04.870 --> 00:14:11.340
Dr. Wakaoji didn't say anything about that.
Where is Dr. Wakaoji now?

00:14:11.670 --> 00:14:13.570
He's off today.

00:14:13.770 --> 00:14:14.770
Off?

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:17.370
Wakaoji is part-time now.

00:14:18.570 --> 00:14:20.170
You hadn't heard?

00:14:21.400 --> 00:14:22.070
No.

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:25.300
H-Hey.
This could turn into something bad!

00:14:25.870 --> 00:14:29.370
Everyone was saying he would be the
next chief physician for sure.

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:31.100
He has no ambition.

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:36.670
He said he wanted to play music again
like he used to long ago. And so...

00:14:40.970 --> 00:14:41.970
Why?

00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:44.670
Jeez! Don't say any more!

00:14:45.100 --> 00:14:46.100
Music?

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:50.700
Dr. Wakaoji...is playing music?

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:53.770
Oh no. Now she knows!

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:05.370
You still haven't been
able to contact Wakaoji?

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:09.070
No... I get his voicemail
on his cell phone.

00:15:09.540 --> 00:15:11.940
I see. Then it can't be helped.

00:15:12.570 --> 00:15:14.000
I have no other idea.

00:15:14.700 --> 00:15:18.440
Dr. Wakaoji said that it could
be controlled with medicine.

00:15:18.940 --> 00:15:20.270
What about that?

00:15:20.640 --> 00:15:22.200
Oh? Let me see...

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:25.700
If nothing else, the progression
of the sickness will be curbed.

00:15:25.800 --> 00:15:30.040
If nothing else?
Doctor, please operate!

00:15:30.370 --> 00:15:31.700
N-No way!

00:15:31.770 --> 00:15:35.140
N-No, that's something
for Wakaoji to decide.

00:15:35.400 --> 00:15:36.870
No, please do it!

00:15:41.800 --> 00:15:42.800
Mitsuki?

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:45.900
Where am I?

00:15:46.600 --> 00:15:49.700
The hospital. You're okay now.

00:15:50.100 --> 00:15:50.770
Surgery?!

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:53.470
The old lady did something
she shouldn't have again!

00:15:53.570 --> 00:15:54.570
I know!

00:15:54.770 --> 00:15:57.600
She outright asked for the surgery!
What should we do?!

00:15:57.700 --> 00:16:00.700
What should we do?!
That puts her voice in jeopardy too.

00:16:03.500 --> 00:16:06.340
Mitsuki, you mustn't in your condition!

00:16:07.670 --> 00:16:08.670
Mitsuki!

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:13.040
Well, that was fun.

00:16:13.340 --> 00:16:15.100
We haven't had a blast
like that in a while, eh?

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:17.640
Ms. Oshige, let's do it again.

00:16:17.670 --> 00:16:19.700
What? Really?!

00:16:23.640 --> 00:16:24.640
What?!

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:27.740
Please arrange for
the surgery immediately!

00:16:27.970 --> 00:16:31.640
W-Well, I must ask Wakaoji.

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:34.770
It'll be fine if I sign
a letter of consent, right?

00:16:37.440 --> 00:16:38.870
Hey, you...

00:16:39.070 --> 00:16:40.070
Grandma!

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:41.100
Mitsuki!

00:16:41.540 --> 00:16:44.240
Umm... I'm okay now.

00:16:44.570 --> 00:16:47.440
What's with you?!
Go back to your hospital room!

00:16:47.600 --> 00:16:48.900
B-But...

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:54.140
Relax, Mitsuki.
Just say you don't want to.

00:16:55.600 --> 00:16:58.470
Say it! Say you don't
want to have surgery!

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:01.900
Jeez, this is irritating.

00:17:01.940 --> 00:17:02.600
Meroko!

00:17:02.970 --> 00:17:03.970
But...

00:17:04.400 --> 00:17:05.840
Is it okay with you
if you lose your voice?

00:17:06.270 --> 00:17:08.900
You get healthy if
you transform into Full Moon,

00:17:08.940 --> 00:17:11.870
but if you lose your voice,
you lose it as Full Moon too!

00:17:11.970 --> 00:17:12.640
What?

00:17:16.240 --> 00:17:16.900
Umm...

00:17:24.070 --> 00:17:27.440
Jeez! What's Wakaoji doing?!

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:33.000
Surgery?! When did it get that bad?

00:17:33.100 --> 00:17:34.100
I don't know!

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:37.040
I didn't find anything unusual
at her last checkup!

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:39.800
Anyway, do the surgery
as quickly as possible!

00:17:40.170 --> 00:17:42.740
As I've said many times,
I'm not authorized to.

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:46.870
That's enough.
I'll try asking another hospital.

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:48.670
Ms. Koyama!

00:17:49.840 --> 00:17:50.840
Sorry I'm late!

00:17:51.900 --> 00:17:53.100
Wakaoji...

00:17:53.640 --> 00:17:54.640
Mitsuki!

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:56.200
When did you start coughing?

00:17:56.740 --> 00:17:57.740
On the day of the party...

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:00.470
Why didn't you tell me then?!

00:18:00.670 --> 00:18:02.170
I-I'm sorry!

00:18:02.470 --> 00:18:03.670
Dr. Wakaoji!

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:06.800
Thank you for taking the time
to come on your day off.

00:18:08.140 --> 00:18:10.570
Sure. I apologize for how I look.

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:15.400
Why didn't you tell me that
you had become part-time?

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:19.700
I'm sorry. I judged that it
wasn't necessary to tell you.

00:18:21.740 --> 00:18:24.040
And that you're playing music.

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:25.370
Well...

00:18:25.970 --> 00:18:26.640
It's okay.

00:18:27.100 --> 00:18:29.940
She doesn't know that
he's Full Moon's producer.

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:35.070
I think mutual trust is
important for a doctor.

00:18:35.400 --> 00:18:38.040
Grandma! It's not his fault!

00:18:38.070 --> 00:18:39.140
I forced him to.

00:18:39.170 --> 00:18:40.770
Forced him to?! What?

00:18:41.670 --> 00:18:43.270
M-Music...

00:18:43.870 --> 00:18:44.540
Excuse me!

00:18:45.040 --> 00:18:46.800
If it's that,
then I'm accountable!

00:18:47.240 --> 00:18:48.270
Who are you?

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:52.340
Oh, Ms. Oshige is Wakaoji's fiancée.

00:18:52.740 --> 00:18:55.000
Oh, no, you have it all wrong!

00:18:55.140 --> 00:18:56.600
Then please be quiet!

00:18:57.100 --> 00:18:58.240
O-Okay.

00:18:59.040 --> 00:19:00.370
Let's talk about that later.

00:19:00.840 --> 00:19:03.570
Anyway, let me examine her!
Okay then, Mitsuki.

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:05.700
Yes.

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:15.100
Okay, we're done.

00:19:17.540 --> 00:19:19.400
H-How is she, Wakaoji?

00:19:19.970 --> 00:19:22.800
Yes... She's indeed getting worse.

00:19:24.540 --> 00:19:25.540
I think surgery...

00:19:30.740 --> 00:19:32.640
will be a last resort,

00:19:32.670 --> 00:19:35.000
and it should be okay to treat you
with medicine for a while.

00:19:42.370 --> 00:19:45.100
A different opinion
than this doctor, huh?

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:48.900
Who should we believe?

00:19:49.640 --> 00:19:51.640
I'm the physician in charge.
Believe me.

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:54.800
Oh, I also think that would be best.

00:19:55.100 --> 00:19:56.640
But, earlier you said...

00:19:56.970 --> 00:19:59.900
Well, that was my individual opinion.

00:20:00.270 --> 00:20:03.040
And Wakaoji's opinion
is not wrong, so...

00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:06.440
But we should ultimately
choose which.

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:19.040
Please, Grandma.

00:20:19.470 --> 00:20:24.740
If it's about the school trip or other things,
I'll do as you say. But...

00:20:25.770 --> 00:20:30.040
Please at least let me decide
to whom I entrust my life.

00:20:41.270 --> 00:20:42.270
Ma'am?!

00:20:46.500 --> 00:20:47.570
Ma'am!

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:48.640
Ms. Koyama!

00:20:50.970 --> 00:20:51.970
Grandma!

00:20:53.840 --> 00:20:54.870
Do as you like.

00:21:04.770 --> 00:21:05.770
Okay, here.

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:09.770
It's stronger medicine than before,
but hang in there, okay?

00:21:10.340 --> 00:21:11.340
O-Okay.

00:21:12.840 --> 00:21:14.640
Has the matter somehow
been settled?

00:21:14.700 --> 00:21:21.240
But we have to hurry before her condition
gets any worse and find Eichi.

00:23:07.040 --> 00:23:08.940
Why?! Why?!

00:23:08.970 --> 00:23:10.040
Huh? What happened?

00:23:10.440 --> 00:23:12.140
No way! That can't be, right?

00:23:12.170 --> 00:23:13.470
I said, what happened?

00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:15.700
No! I can't believe it!

00:23:15.740 --> 00:23:18.000
I said, what happened?!

00:23:18.340 --> 00:23:25.600
On her way to school, she ran into
an old man who can see us Death Spirits!

00:23:25.640 --> 00:23:26.740
What?!

00:23:27.470 --> 00:23:30.800
Next time on Full Moon:
"The Gentleman on the Swing."

00:23:31.570 --> 00:23:32.570
- Look forward to it!
- Look forward to it!
